<title>THAILAND: Thai central bank sets baht rate at 29.096 to dollar.</title>
<headline>Thai central bank sets baht rate at 29.096 to dollar.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand on Wednesday set the weighted average interbank exchange rate at 29.096 to the dollar against 28.922 on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The reference rate is announced daily by the central bank after last Wednesday's managed flotation of the baht.</p>
<p>The daily reference rate is based on the baht's traded average on the previous business day.</p>
<p>The baht was quoted at 28.850/050 per dollar in the offshore market.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
